          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Notre",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✶Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.68.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.68.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "est un",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✶Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.68.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.68.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "de salut",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; et c'est à l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.68.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.68.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", le Seigneur, de faire sortir de la mort.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mais",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.68.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.68.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brisera la tête de ses ennemis, le crâne chevelu de ceux qui marchent dans leurs iniquités.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Le Seigneur a dit : Je ramènerai [les miens] de Basan, je les ramènerai des profondeurs de la mer ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afin que tu trempes ton pied dans le sang de [tes] ennemis, [et] que la langue de tes chiens en ait sa part.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils ont vu ta marche, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.68.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.68.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! la marche de mon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✶Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.68.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.68.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", de mon roi, dans le lieu saint :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les chanteurs allaient devant, ensuite les joueurs d'instruments à cordes, au milieu des jeunes filles jouant du tambourin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dans les congrégations bénissez",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.68.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.68.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", le Seigneur, – vous qui êtes de la source d'Israël !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Là est Benjamin, le petit, qui domine sur eux ; les princes de Juda, leur troupe ; les princes de Zabulon, les princes de Nephthali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ton",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.68.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.68.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a commandé ta force. Établis en force, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.68.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.68.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ce que tu as fait pour nous !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "À cause de ton temple, à Jérusalem, les rois t'apporteront des présents.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tance la bête des roseaux, l'assemblée des forts taureaux, avec les veaux des peuples : [chacun] se prosterne, offrant des lingots d'argent. Disperse les peuples qui trouvent leurs délices dans la guerre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Des grands viendront d'Égypte ; Cush s'empressera d'étendre ses mains vers",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.68.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.68.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Royaumes de la terre, chantez à",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.68.33",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.68.33"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", chantez les louanges du Seigneur, (Sélah)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "À celui qui passe comme à cheval sur les cieux, sur les cieux d'ancienneté ! Voici, il fait retentir sa voix, une voix puissante.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Attribuez la force à",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.68.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.68.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": sa majesté est sur Israël, et sa force dans les nuées.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 68:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu es terrible, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.68.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.68.36"
            ]
          }
        },
